      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HELLO CHEVY (3) rocketed out of the boxes with a strong early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when second (22.09) at Gosford over 388m. Smart beginner who should take advantage of the low draw. Can find winning form. REBORN PASSION (8) has a strong overall record having never missed the frame and boasts three wins from five starts including a last start success (23.04) over 400m at this track. Best form too dangerous to ignore. Have to include. LIPSCHITZ (1) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fourth (17.93) last time in a Grade 5 at Taree Super Track. Good beginner assisted by the inside draw. Should be in this for a long way. MR. SPECKLE (2) cannot be written off despite a miss here at his latest outing.",
